  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_fd943bf630554acdae1a70e2df68b8d5",
      "statement": "The package exports three Vue plugin families — auth (`createRhAuth`/`useAuth`), payments (`createRhPayments`/`usePayments`), and cart (`createRhCart`/`useCart`) — each with its own injection key and reactive store.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/index.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:808389bfc6ab6453f3fa0265eb688dd4093849472b2c70b3db2d1946b814a70e"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4323976c0aca4cec9c9269aaeef50ee9",
      "statement": "`createRhAuth` creates a Vue plugin that provides the `RhAuthStore` via `RH_AUTH_KEY`, runs `checkSession()` once at creation to restore the session, and returns `authGuard`/`publicGuard` navigation guards bound to the same store.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/create.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:49a85acd9b167656d40dd9e0e0de7e23eadb99c40b53ec5704e2243671176a40"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/store.ts#L221-L228",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:810d40cc0ad3307766bd574e71df4e81559649c723d0a2002fd1b1c426c7a767:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c457247419ba4158bc01cce45cd19a4a",
      "statement": "The auth store's `initializing` ref starts `true` and flips to `false` once the initial `checkSession()` settles (whether it succeeds or fails), so guards can await it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/store.ts#L222-L226",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5496fd630a14be4c3630f0cb32e9296e3098ff511d33f4c07141e949a2ffc337:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e14cb79c2ca44625b0d70e79d5432466",
      "statement": "`useAuth()`, `usePayments()`, and `useCart()` inject the store via their typed injection key and throw a descriptive error if the corresponding plugin was not registered.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/use-auth.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:bbc5abc14e9e5540ad05f3fcdf281b9e654d668ffc613541cf6cfeb02ecd8b03"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/use-cart.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:b70e5a7068ac551f5976a5979393c882a4ed8d4b2b85d121f096cee0ec86662e"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/use-payments.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:331de01d6ae5d149a76d554f7735ee7a4d380b488effbf63ce35911eea6a8937"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e4ec5f715f2145cfba3c3bcc09393635",
      "statement": "`createRhPayments` accepts either the `RhAuth` plugin object or the bare `RhAuthStore`, then watches the auth store's `user.team._id.$oid` — not the user object itself — to load/clear the subscription on sign-in/team-switch without triggering on profile edits or consent acceptances.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/create-payments.ts#L37-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9acdeaf766b85b81e2e07f3df6298a64cc12efeec338a9b24bc242d0a2d42a67:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/payments.ts#L140-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:95427acc980a050a3f48586f5fa71c4bc48b7b6ebabafcb63606483733a74cc7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_82c7e8e713484a84ae53a8d45c86b39d",
      "statement": "The payments store is disabled when `config.payments` is not `true` — `loadSubscription` returns `null` and the team-key watcher never fires, so no `/stripe/*` call is made.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/payments.ts#L114-L115",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:496be5b9f7b68fef86d3690d193731c14ae0c89969a5533b66232791dd462d3a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/payments.ts#L143-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a67b6b593e2c224afc039de7643548fd3d3eaf5627331140f1d4bac58f28f52d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3258267f52c641a7a7ad320cc0f11c0e",
      "statement": "`canManageBilling` is a computed that compares `user.team.role` against `config.ownershipRole` (default `'owner'`), not a hardcoded string.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/payments.ts#L113-L118",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:705d7d0c22077bc47016eb9e35e30b5255847f9f58bca28a2107f2d2945e4a5d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df5be24d758b42d7ba3059402dc3fd69",
      "statement": "The cart store is independent of auth (no injection dependency), persists to `localStorage` synchronously alongside state updates — not via a `watch` — and reads as empty on the server where `localStorage` does not exist.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/cart-store.ts#L58-L74",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:11d3c0db4cb016c07049e38036fbf756c36cd3a24948e919dcbde2e002cccc4e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/create-cart.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:4052cc5b94c4e2f0ad7c3fc934c9cefd96468e570d37025f964082a338979656"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f4fd8274a998419eb5072b24dc79c1bf",
      "statement": "Navigation guards check the in-memory `isAuthenticated` computed first and only fall back to a `checkSession()` round trip when it is `false`; `authGuard` redirects to `loginPath` and `publicGuard` redirects to `appPath`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/guards.ts#L28-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c064bcecab14960b3b6cfa11d181d1e160b1cdb14a7b21d1e855b76c73dfee3f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8bd75861aa9c4a6c92e84ff7c7223951",
      "statement": "Nuxt server actions (`rhLogin`, `rhSwitchTeam`, `rhActivate`, `rhResetPassword`) use a `runCapturing` helper that overrides `getToken`/`setToken` on the config to capture the newly issued token into the response cookie instead of writing to `localStorage`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/nuxt/actions.ts#L31-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e60bf47b4a4508717db2832b691e7eb3013febb4c3dc5b31e9232b931b4111a6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e469ca129fbf40439c4daeec4ca3bc8e",
      "statement": "`rhAuthServerMiddleware` proactively renews the token when the current time has passed the configurable threshold fraction (default 0.8) of the token's TTL, writes the renewed token back to the cookie, and deletes expired tokens.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/nuxt/middleware.ts#L35-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fed1463db6a80c910b52ec07f53f4938cb88e54818d3a0d18eb31eb60931c191:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/nuxt/middleware.ts#L86-L103",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd3916b9bc1b80e07d5fee38ffc08c73de6b07e8fa8f3a468736bcc7c1a35786:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0df3966d420b4e79a91ade7d48621114",
      "statement": "The SPA barrel (`src/index.ts`) re-exports all of `@ulabase/kit`, so Vue apps only need `@ulabase/kit-vue` to access both the adapter and core kit types/functions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit-vue/src/index.ts#L20-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31d8ddd6f57e46f041ee131624c19a63e9dd5930b787170b9f0ab3e107529662:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d934fa23eba0498992e4c5a838d2faa1",
      "statement": "The `RhAuthStore` interface includes `acceptConsents(body?, mode?)` (returns `UserInfo`), `renewToken(mode?)` (returns `string | null`), and `updateUser(email, updates)` — methods not present on all other adapters.",
      "evidence": [
